---
title: Teriyaki Chicken
servings: 8
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Medium
cuisine: Japanese
tags:
- poultry
- savoury
- main-course
- japanese
---

De-bone and score the @chicken legs{8}.

Mix the other ingredients ((@water{50%g}, @light soy sauce{50%g}, @honey{3%tsp}, @garlic{3%cloves}(pounded), @ground or grated ginger{0.5%tsp}, @saki, rice wine, or dry sherry{1%tsp}, and @oil{75%g})) and marinade the chicken.

Barbecue at the side of a slow fire. Cook the meat part first, adding the skin part way through to prevent the meat becoming too dry.